[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "久方ぶりの我が地元……\n景色も雰囲気も何も変わっておらぬな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Home... after so long away. Nothing's changed at all, has it. Not the scenery, not the air..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お待ちしておりました、鬼門様",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We have been expecting you, Lady Kimon."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "従者",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "従者"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……どうも、ご無沙汰しております。\nお迎え感謝いたしまする",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Hello. It's been a while. Thank you for coming to meet me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "当主様がお待ちです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The master is waiting for you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "従者",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "従者"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……うむ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Right."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "父上……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Father..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おお……戻ったか、鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah... you've returned, Kimon."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "父親",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "父親"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ご加減はいかがでございますか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "How are you feeling?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "余計な気遣いはいらぬ。\n……それより、お前を呼んだ理由、分かっておるな？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No need to fuss over me. ...More importantly, you know why I called you back?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "父親",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "父親"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……はい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I do."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "断りなく家を飛び出し、長らく便りも寄こさず……\nご迷惑をおかけいたしました",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I left without a word and sent no letters for so long. I'm sorry for the trouble I caused."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それはもうよい。それで、お前の意志はどうなのだ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's done with. What matters now is—what do you want to do?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "父親",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "父親"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "すでに家を継ぐ覚悟はできておりまする。\n次期当主として、再び忍びの修行に打ち込み――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I am ready to take up my duties. I will devote myself to my training and assume my place as the next head of the clan—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お前は、何かやるべきことがあって、\n家を出ていたのではなかったのか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Was there not something you still needed to do? Something that made you leave in the first place?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "父親",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "父親"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それは……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それは、もう終わった話でございまする。\n父上が気にされるようなことでは……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That is over and done with. It is nothing for you to concern yourself with, Father..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……仲間に恵まれ、大きな舞台に立ち、\nようやく活動が軌道に乗り始めていた。それなのにか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...You found companions. You stood on a great stage. Your work was finally beginning to find its footing. And you would throw all that away?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "父親",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "父親"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え……？\u3000父上がなぜそれを……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...How do you know about that?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お前の動向は、家の者に見張らせていた。\n初めはすぐにでも連れ戻すつもりだったのだがな……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I had the household keep watch over you. I intended to bring you home at once at first, but..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "父親",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "父親"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お前は我らのような古い世代とは違う、\n新たな忍びの形を模索しようとしていた。そうだろう？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You were searching for a new way to be a ninja. Something different from us old-fashioned types. Wasn't that it?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "父親",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "父親"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……はい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Yes."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この争いのない太平の世にあって、かつての\n忍びというものは役目を終えたと思っておりました",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "In a world at peace, with no wars to fight, I thought the old ways of the ninja had run their course."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ならばこの忍術はなんのために使えばよいのか……\nそこで行きついたのがアイドルの道でございまする",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If that was so, what were these skills even for? That is what led me to the path of idol work."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ならば、なぜそれを捨てようとする？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then why are you trying to abandon it?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "父親",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "父親"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そ、それはどういう……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wh-What do you mean...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "我が家の伝統とは、あくまで技術の継承のためのもの。\nそれをどう使うかは、次期当主であるお前が決めるのだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Our clan's traditions exist to pass down our arts. How those arts are used—that is for the next head to decide."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "父親",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "父親"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "当然、継承のための修行や家の仕事はやってもらう。\nだが、それと両立できるのであれば……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You will still train and tend to the clan's duties, of course. But if you can manage both..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "父親",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "父親"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アイドルの道を、諦める必要などない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There is no reason you must give up being an idol."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "父親",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "父親"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "父上……！\u3000そ、それはまことにございますか！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Father...! Do you mean that?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "当主様は、密かに鬼門様の活動を\n応援なさっていたのですよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The master has quietly been cheering you on all along, my lady."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "従者",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "従者"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "舞台に上がる際には、我々に動画を撮影させたりも……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "He even had us record video whenever you performed on stage..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "従者",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "従者"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうなのですか……！？\u3000いや、それはちょっと\nマナー的にどうかと思いまするが……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "He did...?! I appreciate the sentiment, but I am not sure that is exactly proper etiquette..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ごほん！\u3000ごほん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ahem! Ahem!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "父親",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "父親"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "とはいえ、直接伝えるのも恥ずかしかったのでしょう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Though I suppose he was too embarrassed to say any of this to your face."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "従者",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "従者"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よく手紙をしたためては、\nわざわざ偽名を使ってまで送っていらっしゃいました",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "He wrote you many a letter over the years. Even went so far as to send them under a false name."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "従者",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "従者"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "――っ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "―!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "父上だったのですね……\n拙者の心を、ずっと支えてくださっていたのは",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It was you all along, Father... You were the one who kept my spirits up."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ありがとうございまする……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you... so much...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "して、どうする？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So then. What will it be?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "父親",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "父親"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……忍びも、アイドルも。\nどちらも背負ってみせましょうぞ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Both ninja and idol. I'll carry them both—and I won't let either one down!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]